From: hedongdong <hdd475375904@126.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 15:35:37 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 09/27] refactor: consolidate A5 adapters and expose MoE queue
 policies

Keep the adopted math, QP0 owners, transfer completion and serialized schedules unchanged. Share MX host registration and launch wrappers; scope task adapters to MegaMoE. Add explicit queue lookahead options and read-only plan inspection without speculative policies.
